### 2. Redux Store & RTK Query Base

#### [NEW] [store.ts](file:///c:/Users/Htoo%20Myat%20Nyi%20Nyi/Desktop/project24/web_sss/src/store/store.ts)
Configure Redux store with RTK Query middleware + auth slice.

#### [NEW] [baseApi.ts](file:///c:/Users/Htoo%20Myat%20Nyi%20Nyi/Desktop/project24/web_sss/src/store/baseApi.ts)
Single `createApi` base with `baseQuery` pointed at `/api`, automatic `Authorization: Bearer` header injection.

#### [NEW] [authSlice.ts](file:///c:/Users/Htoo%20Myat%20Nyi%20Nyi/Desktop/project24/web_sss/src/store/authSlice.ts)
Manages `{ token, user }` in Redux state + localStorage persistence.

---

### 3. RTK Query API Slices (one file per module)

All under `src/store/api/`. Each injects endpoints into `baseApi`.

| File | Endpoints |
|------|-----------|
| `authApi.ts` | `register`, `login`, `getMe` |
| `studentsApi.ts` | `getStudents`, `getStudent`, `createStudent`, `updateStudent`, `deleteStudent` |
| `departmentsApi.ts` | `getDepartments`, `getDepartment`, `createDepartment`, `updateDepartment`, `deleteDepartment` |
| `coursesApi.ts` | `getCourses`, `getCourse`, `createCourse`, `updateCourse`, `deleteCourse` |
| `sectionsApi.ts` | `getSections`, `getSection`, `createSection`, `updateSection`, `deleteSection` |
| `enrollmentApi.ts` | `createEnrollment`, `deleteEnrollment`, `getStudentEnrollments`, `getSectionEnrollments` |
| `gradesApi.ts` | `createGrade`, `updateGrade`, `getStudentGrades` |
| `attendanceApi.ts` | `createAttendance`, `bulkAttendance`, `getSectionAttendance`, `getStudentAttendance` |
| `feesApi.ts` | `createFee`, `getStudentFees`, `createPayment`, `getFeePayments` |
| `announcementsApi.ts` | `getAnnouncements`, `createAnnouncement`, `updateAnnouncement`, `deleteAnnouncement` |
| `libraryApi.ts` | `getBooks`, `createBook`, `borrowBook`, `returnBook`, `getStudentBorrows` |
| `examsApi.ts` | `createExam`, `getSectionExams`, `createResult`, `bulkResults`, `getStudentResults`, `getExamResults` |

